  "content": "<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fcgwZZjIG8c?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>替代雨聲</strong> 資源包將預設的雨聲和雷聲替換為更真實且富有氛圍的音效。現在雨聲比預設的 Minecraft 音效更加豐富。雷聲也經過更新，擁有更具戲劇性和震撼力的聲音。使用此資源包，您將能更深入地沉浸在遊戲中。希望您會喜歡 :)</span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>常見問題：</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">任何人都可以在自己的模組包中使用此資源包。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">授權與原始音效：</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252frain-and-thunder-nature-sounds-7803%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/rain-and-thunder-nature-sounds-7803/</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fsoft-rain-ambient-111154%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/soft-rain-ambient-111154/</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fnatural-thunder-113219%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/natural-thunder-113219/</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fbone666138%252fsounds%252f198857%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/bone666138/sounds/198857/</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fthunder-24571%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/thunder-24571/</a></strong></span></p>",
